1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,264
Hey, I'm Clement,
an AI avatar.

2
00:00:02,314 --> 00:00:04,565
We're building your
Graduation party 2027

3
00:00:04,615 --> 00:00:06,757
website with AI, and
you help shape it.

4
00:00:06,827 --> 00:00:09,236
And I'm Casey,
also an AI avatar.

5
00:00:09,286 --> 00:00:11,095
A few questions are
coming up where you

6
00:00:11,145 --> 00:00:11,792
get to decide.

7
00:00:11,867 --> 00:00:13,012
Let's start with signing in.

8
00:00:13,062 --> 00:00:15,690
The plan: your email
address, no password.

9
00:00:16,007 --> 00:00:17,610
You type your email
address into the

10
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:17,968
portal.

11
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:20,320
You get an email
with a link.

12
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:22,074
Tap it, and the portal
knows the address

13
00:00:22,124 --> 00:00:22,502
is yours.

14
00:00:22,552 --> 00:00:24,154
Email, link, done.

15
00:00:24,454 --> 00:00:26,321
Next, the editor, your tool.

16
00:00:26,371 --> 00:00:27,823
No coding needed.

17
00:00:27,873 --> 00:00:30,501
One finger is enough,
ideally on an iPad.

18
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:33,030
On the left are
building blocks, like a

19
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:35,253
heading, text, a
photo or a countdown.

20
00:00:35,303 --> 00:00:37,406
Tap one and drag it
where you want it.

21
00:00:37,456 --> 00:00:38,230
Don't like it?

22
00:00:38,279 --> 00:00:39,195
Drag it away again.

23
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:41,486
Important: whatever
you build is only a

24
00:00:41,536 --> 00:00:42,448
proposal at first.

25
00:00:42,498 --> 00:00:44,303
It goes online only
when the deciding

26
00:00:44,353 --> 00:00:45,768
group, the
committee, agrees.

27
00:00:46,068 --> 00:00:47,057
Don't feel like typing?

28
00:00:47,107 --> 00:00:49,262
Tell the AI helper
what to build, for

29
00:00:49,312 --> 00:00:51,002
example: make
the page green.

30
00:00:51,052 --> 00:00:52,619
You see the
proposal right away.

31
00:00:52,669 --> 00:00:54,335
It goes online only
when the committee

32
00:00:54,385 --> 00:00:54,907
approves it.

33
00:00:55,218 --> 00:00:57,082
Three AI helpers
build with us.

34
00:00:57,132 --> 00:00:59,514
Salt, the Quality
Bot, checks quality

35
00:00:59,564 --> 00:01:01,881
every ten minutes
and has 79 skills.

36
00:01:02,331 --> 00:01:04,586
Pepper, the Response
Bot, looks into the

37
00:01:04,636 --> 00:01:07,003
inbox every ten minutes
and has 54 skills.

38
00:01:07,453 --> 00:01:09,839
And Chili, the
Security and Litigation

39
00:01:09,889 --> 00:01:12,337
Bot, watches over
privacy and copyright

40
00:01:12,387 --> 00:01:14,523
around the clock,
with 133 skills.

41
00:01:14,823 --> 00:01:17,023
Now something to join
in: the profile card

42
00:01:17,073 --> 00:01:17,703
or portrait.

43
00:01:17,753 --> 00:01:19,684
One kid can be
described by another,

44
00:01:19,734 --> 00:01:21,719
kindly and with only
positive things.

45
00:01:22,019 --> 00:01:22,906
Here's how it works.

46
00:01:22,956 --> 00:01:25,114
One: a kid writes
about another.

47
00:01:25,164 --> 00:01:27,992
Two: anything mean is
stopped right away.

48
00:01:28,042 --> 00:01:30,111
Three: the person
described sees the text

49
00:01:30,161 --> 00:01:31,827
first, alone, and
can improve it.

50
00:01:31,877 --> 00:01:34,961
Four: they decide
whether it appears, and

51
00:01:35,011 --> 00:01:37,498
under 16 their
parents agree too.

52
00:01:37,548 --> 00:01:38,822
They get the final say.

53
00:01:38,872 --> 00:01:40,967
Without their yes,
everything is deleted

54
00:01:41,017 --> 00:01:41,751
after 30 days.

55
00:01:42,209 --> 00:01:45,549
Two examples: Louis,
15, likes extra spicy

56
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:47,993
kebab, skates
and mixes music.

57
00:01:48,043 --> 00:01:51,248
Lollo, 16, takes photos
and makes everyone

58
00:01:51,298 --> 00:01:52,157
look great.

59
00:01:52,207 --> 00:01:54,215
Be brave and send
in creative pages!

60
00:01:54,529 --> 00:01:55,797
AI or by hand?

61
00:01:55,847 --> 00:01:57,807
You decide, both
are equally good.

62
00:01:57,857 --> 00:01:59,992
You stay the authors,
the AI only makes

63
00:02:00,042 --> 00:02:00,701
suggestions.

64
00:02:01,001 --> 00:02:02,558
And this isn't just
for this class.

65
00:02:02,608 --> 00:02:04,453
Every class at the
school can use the

66
00:02:04,503 --> 00:02:05,799
website for its own party.

67
00:02:05,849 --> 00:02:07,949
You're the first, and
what you learn helps

68
00:02:07,999 --> 00:02:08,449
everyone.

69
00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:10,997
Question A: Who
approves changes before

70
00:02:11,047 --> 00:02:11,888
they go online?

71
00:02:12,315 --> 00:02:14,280
Question B, really
important: photos.

72
00:02:14,330 --> 00:02:16,632
Photos only go up
with the yes of the

73
00:02:16,682 --> 00:02:19,108
person in them, and
if you're under 16,

74
00:02:19,158 --> 00:02:21,213
your parents have
to say yes too.

75
00:02:21,558 --> 00:02:23,535
Question C: Who checks
submitted photos

76
00:02:23,585 --> 00:02:24,549
before they appear?

77
00:02:24,935 --> 00:02:27,266
Question D: Which
pages do we want?

78
00:02:27,316 --> 00:02:28,400
You can tick several.

79
00:02:28,761 --> 00:02:31,032
Question F: Who can
send requests to the

80
00:02:31,082 --> 00:02:31,655
AI helper?

81
00:02:32,008 --> 00:02:34,575
Question G: What
happens after the party?

82
00:02:34,625 --> 00:02:36,278
Does the site stay
up, or does it get

83
00:02:36,328 --> 00:02:36,682
deleted?

84
00:02:37,035 --> 00:02:39,065
Question H: Who gets
onto the site, and

85
00:02:39,115 --> 00:02:40,366
who is in the committee?

86
00:02:40,416 --> 00:02:41,469
You can tick several.

87
00:02:41,810 --> 00:02:44,106
Question I: How do
we want to build?

88
00:02:44,156 --> 00:02:46,378
With voice, with
a finger, or both?

89
00:02:46,753 --> 00:02:48,694
Question J: How do
we get your parents'

90
00:02:48,744 --> 00:02:49,241
agreement?

91
00:02:49,291 --> 00:02:50,671
Without it, no photos.

92
00:02:50,944 --> 00:02:52,016
Everything ticked?

93
00:02:52,066 --> 00:02:53,431
Then tap Submit.

94
00:02:53,481 --> 00:02:55,520
Your answers get
saved together, so the

95
00:02:55,570 --> 00:02:56,721
whole class has a say.

96
00:02:56,981 --> 00:02:57,983
A few house rules.

97
00:02:58,033 --> 00:02:59,949
One: nothing mean
about others.

98
00:02:59,999 --> 00:03:01,332
Two: nothing private.

99
00:03:01,382 --> 00:03:03,005
Three: no photos
without a clear yes.

100
00:03:03,055 --> 00:03:04,784
Stick to that, and
everyone has fun.

101
00:03:04,834 --> 00:03:07,142
Teachers and parents
find the full rules

102
00:03:07,192 --> 00:03:09,500
in a separate video
at the bottom of the

103
00:03:09,550 --> 00:03:09,845
page.

104
00:03:10,145 --> 00:03:11,951
You'll answer the
questions right below.

105
00:03:12,001 --> 00:03:14,387
I wish you all the
best and a really great

106
00:03:14,437 --> 00:03:14,783
party.

107
00:03:14,833 --> 00:03:15,555
See you soon!

